{"Saturn":{"1":"Saturn in its own place causes wounds from swords and diseases","2":"in the second place it takes away honor","3":"in the third it overcomes sickness and one's enemies and produces status","4":"in the fourth Saturn destroys good qualities and friendship","5":"in the fifth it gives sons and money","6":"in the sixth Saturn produces position and wealth","7":"in the seventh it causes wandering and destroys one's wife","8":"in the eighth it produces diseases, the destruction of wealth, and (the appearance of) enemies","9":"in the ninth Saturn destroys one's means of making money","10":"in the tenth it takes away (the profit from) one's actions","11":"in the eleventh Saturn produces success in several pleasures and in wealth","12":"and in the twelfth wandering and fear"},"Sun":{"1":"Saturn in the place of the Sun gives happiness, money, joy and pleasure","2":"in the second wealth","3":"in the third it destroys honor, beauty, and strength","4":"in the fourth it abets the happiness from one's relatives","5":"in the fifth Saturn produces sickness and anxiety about one's sons","6":"in the sixth strife","7":"in the seventh it gives happiness and joy from one's wife","8":"in the eighth Saturn destroys disease and confusion","9":"in the ninth Saturn determines the appearance of evil","10":"in the tenth success in one's activities","11":"in the eleventh it causes the acquisition of much good and money","12":"in the twelfth the loss of one's employment"},"Jupiter":{"1":"Saturn in the place of Jupiter causes delusion","2":"in the second it destroys good","3":"in the third it produces conflict and quarrels","4":"in the fourth loss of one's relatives and anxiety","5":"in the fifth it gives sons, possessions, honor, and glory","6":"in the sixth it produces fame","7":"in the seventh Saturn causes the loss of one's wife and agitation","8":"in the eighth death","9":"in the ninth Saturn gives distress from one's own servants and from low people","10":"in the tenth it destroys beauty","11":"in the eleventh it causes the acquisition of hoards ( of money) with little effort","12":"and in the twelfth strength in one's body"},"Venus":{"1":"Saturn in the place of Venus takes away one's beauty and one's wife","2":"in the second it takes away wealth","3":"in the third it gives evils, separation, sorrow, and hatred","4":"in the fourth it causes strife","5":"in the fifth Saturn causes imprisonment or wandering","6":"in the sixth lordship, honor, and wealth","7":"in the seventh anxiety and despondency because of one's wife","8":"in the eighth disease","9":"in the ninth poverty and wandering","10":"in the tenth Saturn destroys prosperity","11":"and in the eleventh and twelfth it gives position, brilliance, joy, wealth, children, and slaves","12":"and in the eleventh and twelfth it gives position, brilliance, joy, wealth, children, and slaves"},"Mars":{"1":"Saturn in the place of Mars gives unrighteousness (adharma), quarreling, and disease","2":"in the second Saturn causes loss","3":"in the third the destruction of quarreling and strength","4":"in the fourth many deceits","5":"in the fifth the acquisition of authority, sons, and wealth","6":"in the sixth an increase in one's good qualities and lordship","7":"in the seventh Saturn produces quarrels, fatigue, and illness","8":"in the eighth it gives burns and wounds","9":"in the ninth Saturn gives divisions and jealousy","10":"in the tenth success with regard to honor, sons, and wealth","11":"in the eleventh the best profits and acquisitions","12":"and in the twelfth physical pleasure"},"Mercury":{"1":"Saturn in the place of Mercury causes loss and disease","2":"in the second bewilderment of the mind","3":"in the third separation from one's allies","4":"in the fourth the destruction of friendship and trust","5":"in the fifth Saturn causes improper conduct of one's sons and confusion","6":"in the sixth success with respect to one's mind, fame, good qualities, and wealth","7":"in the seventh Saturn produces the appearance of inauspiciousness in one's speech","8":"in the eighth physical pleasure","9":"in the ninth Saturn causes success with respect to righteousness (dharma) and money","10":"in the tenth acquisition through work involving speech and the intellect","11":"in the eleventh the obtaining of lands and quadrupeds","12":"and in the twelfth honor and learning"},"Moon":{"1":"Saturn in the place of the Moon establishes imprisonment, wandering, (injuries from) swords, wind-diseases, poison, fire, enemies, distress, and loss of one's wife, sons, and property","2":"in the second place it causes expense and pain","3":"in the third Saturn gives the destruction of one's enemies, honor, joy, beauty, and many acquisitions","4":"in the fourth it causes the disrespect of one's relatives, the loss of beauty, fear of enemies, and illness","5":"in the fifth Saturn produces the loss of position, business enterprises, sons, and wealth, the hatred of one's relatives, and quarrels","6":"in the sixth it gives the destruction of one's enemies, joy, happiness, and wealth","7":"in the seventh Saturn causes the loss of beauty, fatigue, diseases of the genitals, the death of one's wife and friends, and wandering","8":"in the eighth theft, hunger, bondage, death, misery, and disease","9":"in the ninth Saturn gives illness, wandering, quarrels, fatigue, loss of one's possessions, hunger, and misery","10":"in the tenth it destroys one's lordship, the profits of one's actions, and one's hoards, and produces disease and dishonor","11":"in the eleventh Saturn gives glory, other men's wives, wealth, slaves, possessions, success in business, status, and honor","12":"and in the twelfth it takes away cleverness in one's actions, fame, brilliance, and honor"},"Ascendant":{"1":"Saturn in the ascendent always causes honor from the rulers of cities, towns, and tribes, (the possession of) metals (lohani), and the acquisition of wealth","2":"in the second place it causes infamy and a decrease in one's wealth","3":"in the third the destruction of bad things, good profits, success, honor, respect, and health","4":"in the fourth place from the ascendent Saturn produces houses, money, friendship with one's relatives, and power","5":"in the fifth Saturn causes victory, wealth, prosperity, progeny, sons, and strength","6":"in the sixth health, joy, brilliance, the destruction of one's foes, fame, diligence, and power","7":"in the seventh Saturn gives the death of one's wife, weariness, exile to a foreign land, and illness","8":"in the eighth Saturn gives loss of one's wife, sons, and property, imprisonment, death, and disease","9":"in the ninth Saturn causes long wanderings, diseases, bodily confinement by one's enemies, and hatred","10":"in the tenth honor, joy in one's actions, position, and prosperity","11":"in the eleventh place from the ascendent Saturn gives metals (loha), quadrupeds, and so on, as well as women, grain, slaves, and black garments","12":"and in the twelfth it produces poverty, misery, and despair"}}