{"Jupiter":{"1":"Jupiter in its own place and in the second causes the acquisition of position, sons, wealth, and honor","2":"Jupiter in its own place and in the second causes the acquisition of position, sons, wealth, and honor","3":"in the third success with regard to victory and wealth","4":"in the fourth the attainment of joy and happiness","5":"in the fifth despondency, poverty, and wandering","6":"in the sixth agitation because of one's enemies, sleepiness, fatigue, and disease","7":"in the seventh and eighth the acquisition of food, women, good health, sons, and money","8":"in the seventh and eighth the acquisition of food, women, good health, sons, and money","9":"in the ninth it destroys one's intelligence and memory","10":"in the tenth it gives position, glory, and wealth","11":"in the eleventh Jupiter causes success with regard to acquisitions","12":"and in the twelfth it gives weariness"},"Sun":{"1":"Jupiter in the place of the Sun causes the acquisition of intelligence, friends, and money","2":"in the second it gives wealth","3":"in the third it produces illnesses, poverty, enemies, and losses","4":"in the fourth status, fame, and renown","5":"in the fifth Jupiter causes diseases, punishment by the king, and wandering","6":"in the sixth imprisonment","7":"in the seventh the appearance of joy and happiness","8":"in the eighth sickness and the loss of one's money","9":"in the ninth success with regard to righteousness (dharma) and wealth, and happiness","10":"in the tenth profit in one's activities, joy, and authority","11":"in the eleventh the acquisition of garments and gold","12":"and in the twelfth Jupiter gives enemies, fatigue, and grief"},"Saturn":{"1":"Jupiter in the place of Saturn gives perturbation","2":"in the second it causes the loss of one's wealth","3":"in the third it gives the acquisition of lands, wealth, and money","4":"in the fourth various injuries","5":"in the fifth it produces joy from one's sons and power","6":"in the sixth good qualities, authority, victory, and wealth","7":"in the seventh miseries, diseases, and illness","8":"in the eighth Jupiter causes sickness and takes away one's money","9":"in the ninth Jupiter gives the appearance of evil, and weariness","10":"in the tenth injuries, quarrels, and reproaches","11":"in the eleventh and twelfth vast possessions","12":"in the eleventh and twelfth vast possessions"},"Venus":{"1":"Jupiter in the place of Venus causes mental anguish and despair","2":"in the second it gives women and wealth","3":"in the third it causes an increase in strife with one's wife and in her anger","4":"in the fourth quarrels with one's elders (guru) and relatives","5":"in the fifth wealth and the begetting of sons","6":"in the sixth Jupiter causes the crushing of one's enemies, and wealth","7":"in the seventh it gives quarrels with one's wife, wanderings, and delusion","8":"in the eighth it takes away joy, happiness, and wealth","9":"in the ninth Jupiter causes an increase in one's good qualities, money, and righteousness (dharma)","10":"in the tenth it gives wealth","11":"in the eleventh Jupiter gives the acquisition of women, wealth, and grain","12":"and in the twelfth the loss of these"},"Mars":{"1":"Jupiter in the place of Mars destroys one's foes","2":"in the second it gives brilliance and joy","3":"in the third it produces agitation and quarrels","4":"in the fourth (the native) possesses friendship and honor","5":"in the fifth it overcomes the fear of one's enemies","6":"in the sixth it produces fatigue, misfortune, and old age","7":"in the seventh diseases, enemies, and grief","8":"in the eighth it destroys what pertains to victory and joy","9":"in the ninth it takes away one's beauty and destroys one's wealth","10":"in the tenth it produces position, good qualities, and prosperity","11":"in the eleventh Jupiter causes the acquisition of lands and gold","12":"and in the twelfth expenses"},"Mercury":{"1":"Jupiter in the place of Mercury causes the thriving of one's voice and intellect","2":"in the second an increase in one's honor","3":"in the third it destroys honor, happiness, and status","4":"in the fourth (the native) possesses honor, profits, and money","5":"in the fifth it destroys fame and wealth","6":"in the sixth it obstructs beauty, pleasure, and glory","7":"in the seventh Jupiter abets one's joy and good qualities","8":"in the eighth it causes soundness of one's voice and mind","9":"in the ninth it destroys one's voice and intellect","10":"in the tenth it gives the acquisition of righteousness ( dharma) and income","11":"in the eleventh Jupiter gives success with regard to knowledge, happiness, and wealth","12":"and in the twelfth stupidity"},"Moon":{"1":"Jupiter in the place of the Moon causes delusion, loss of money, the destruction of one's status and honor, fatigue, wandering, all sorts of diseases, opposition, and quarrels","2":"in the second it gives position, sons, authority, and wealth","3":"in the third Jupiter causes the loss of one's people and money, hindrance in one's business, wandering, weariness, and cheating","4":"in the fourth contempt, a decrease in one's goods, reproach, the death of one's relatives, and anxiety","5":"in the fifth it gives servants, clothes, position, gold, honor, and sons, and conquers one's foes","6":"in the sixth Jupiter causes quarrels with one's relatives, disputes, terror, and the loss of the profits of one's activities","7":"in the seventh it produces ( the enjoyment of) women, houses, food, and drink, handsomeness, and extremely profitable journeys","8":"in the eighth Jupiter causes the destruction of one's wealth and relatives, diseases, fatigue, poverty, and quarrels","9":"in the ninth Jupiter produces outstanding success with regard to one's sons, wife, lands, position, honor, and wealth","10":"in the tenth it causes eye-diseases, the loss of one's goods, phlegmatic illnesses, difficulties, and the death of one's sons","11":"in the eleventh Jupiter gives lands, houses, sons, women, gold, grain, clothes, and vehicles","12":"and in the twelfth from the Moon it causes travel in foreign countries, weariness, and poverty"},"Ascendant":{"1":"Jupiter in the ascendent gives gold, cows, horses, sons, lands, children, knowledge, sexual intercourse, position, glory, and food","2":"in the second it produces the honor, happiness, and wealth of men (the natives)","3":"in the third Jupiter causes the appearance of quarrels with one's relatives and one's enemies, of anger, reproach, and decline","4":"in the fourth success with regard to one's own dharma, strings of pearls, houses, and money","5":"in the fifth from the ascendent Jupiter gives dignity, honor, sons, fame, and wealth","6":"in the sixth it establishes the bringing forth of good qualities, the acquisition of glory and wealth, the destruction of one's enemies, power, and beauty","7":"in the seventh it produces food, women, clothes, perfume, garlands, and pleasure, and destroys disease","8":"in the eighth Jupiter causes phlegmatic (diseases), old age, ( the bites of) snakes, wandering, imprisonment, and terror of one's enemies","9":"in the ninth Jupiter causes the acquisition of position, money, knowledge, sons, and righteousness (dharma), and happiness","10":"in the tenth authority, the acquisition of wealth and honor from kings, and success in business","11":"in the eleventh Jupiter causes the acquisition of cows, lands, grain, clothes, gold, children, knowledge, houses, and food","12":"and in the twelfth it gives profitless journeys and expenses"}}