{"Mars":{"Mars":"If (the Moon) is in a navamsa of Mars and if it is aspected by Mars, (the native) is a fierce thief who takes pleasure in murder and killing.","Venus":"If aspected by Venus, one who is rich in drink, wealth, and women.","Mercury":"If aspected by Mercury, a thief who keeps changing his residence.","Sun":"If aspected by the Sun, a guardian who kills Dasyus.","Jupiter":"If aspected by Jupiter, an intelligent king rich in good qualities.","Saturn":"If aspected by Saturn, an angry man attached to strife who is dragged down by many fears."},"Venus":{"Venus":"The Moon in a navamsa of Venus, if it is aspected by Venus, produces a happy man rich in grain, wealth, and women.","Mercury":"If aspected by Mercury, one who knows such things as singing and speaking.","Jupiter":"If aspected by Jupiter, a poet of famous intellect.","Mars":"If aspected by Mars, a lover of other men's wives.","Sun":"If aspected by the Sun, one who has abundant food and drink, but little intelligence.","Saturn":"If aspected by Saturn, a hero delighting (women) by sexual intercourse or an expert in sexual intercourse."},"Mercury":{"Mercury":"The Moon in a navamsa of Mercury, if it is aspected by Mercury, produces an eloquent man who knows such things as the meaning of the sciences and the crafts.","Venus":"If aspected by Venus, an expert in singing, story-telling, and sexual intercourse.","Jupiter":"If aspected by Jupiter, the counsellor (saciva) of a king, one who understands politics.","Mars":"If aspected by Mars, an intelligent and prominent thief.","Sun":"If aspected by the Sun, an actor who knows the rules.","Saturn":"If aspected by Saturn, an intelligent man learned in the rules of the crafts."},"Moon":{"Sun":"The Moon in its own navamsa, if it is aspected by the Sun, produces a man whose wallet and body are both thin and who experiences much sorrow from riots.","Mars":"If aspected by Mars, a greedy person who delights in taking money.","Jupiter":"If aspected by Jupiter, a wise man of noble firmness.","Venus":"If aspected by Venus, one addicted to the posture and acts of women.","Mercury":"If aspected by Mercury, an ascetic who restrains himself.","Saturn":"If aspected by Saturn, a clever person who is wise in his activities, but is afflicted by sorrow arising from bondage and wandering."},"Sun":{"Sun":"The Moon in a navamsa of the Sun, if it is aspected by the Sun, produces a very angry man, a drunkard who is not to be assailed.","Mars":"If aspected by Mars, a cruel man who is wealthy and honored by the king.","Saturn":"If aspected by Saturn, a destroyer of life.","Venus":"If aspected by Venus, a wealthy man who is afflicted by grief caused by his wife and sons.","Mercury":"If aspected by Mercury, one who delights in slander.","Jupiter":"If aspected by Jupiter, a rich, fat man."},"Jupiter":{"Jupiter":"The Moon in a navamsa of Jupiter, if it is aspected by Jupiter, produces a man of pure character who possesses intelligence and courage.","Venus":"If aspected by Venus, a firm man attached to the objects of the senses.","Mercury":"If aspected by Mercury, one who is learned in poetry and in the sacred traditions (sruti).","Mars":"If aspected by Mars, a fierce man clever with swords and weapons.","Sun":"If aspected by the Sun, a strong, but infamous man.","Saturn":"If aspected by Saturn, a wise man who looks like an elder and has a bad king."},"Saturn":{"Saturn":"The Moon in a navamsa of Saturn, if it is aspected by Saturn, produces a pitiable pauper racked by disease.","Mars":"If aspected by Mars, a wealthy man with many sorrows.","Sun":"If aspected by the Sun, a cruel person whose property has vanished.","Venus":"If aspected by Venus, one who possesses old women, widows, and women of bad character.","Mercury":"If aspected by Mercury, a man who enjoys suffering.","Jupiter":"If aspected by Jupiter, a well behaved and distinguished person who is intent on good conduct and on giving pleasure."}}