{"Venus":{"1":"Venus in its own place gives the destruction of one's wealth and wisdom","2":"in the second strife with one's wife","3":"in the third it destroys honor, wealth, and brilliance","4":"in the fourth it gives honor from one's own relatives and expensive things","5":"in the fifth it causes injuries and wandering and destroys one's wealth","6":"in the sixth it produces intelligence, beauty, and honor","7":"in the seventh sexual intercourse with women and food","8":"in the eighth Venus causes distress from low people","9":"in the ninth it destroys cleanliness and sexual intercourse and gives wandering","10":"in the tenth it destroys pleasure and profits from one's actions","11":"in the eleventh Venus produces women, silver, and food","12":"and in the twelfth joy and beauty"},"Sun":{"1":"Venus in the place of the Sun gives little happiness and anguish","2":"in the second it causes excessive expenditures","3":"in the third (it produces) quarrels with one's sons and wife and fear","4":"and in the fourth goading and piercing by one's enemies","5":"in the fifth it gives loss of wealth, wandering, and disease","6":"in the sixth Venus destroys joy, happiness, and money","7":"in the seventh it causes strife with one's wife and breaking","8":"in the eighth pleasure and good health","9":"in the ninth Venus causes the appearance of wounds and roaming","10":"in the tenth the loss of one's money","11":"in the eleventh Venus gives the acquisition of gold","12":"and in the twelfth cleanliness and food"},"Saturn":{"1":"Venus in the place of Saturn gives strife, hunger, and quarrels","2":"in the second diseases","3":"in the third it causes the acquisition of cows, buffaloes, and money","4":"in the fourth success with regard to friends and wealth","5":"in the fifth Venus causes the acquisition of position, wealth, and money","6":"in the sixth the appearance of pride, fatigue, and illness","7":"in the seventh diseases of the genitals","8":"in the eighth the acquisition of position, glory, and happiness","9":"in the ninth Venus causes the acquisition of women and property","10":"in the tenth the appearance of honor and happiness","11":"in the eleventh the acquisition of women, extravagant things, and money","12":"and in the twelfth pain"},"Jupiter":{"1":"Venus in the place of Jupiter takes away beauty, intellect, and exercise","2":"in the second it causes destruction","3":"in the third expenditure of one's money and quarrels","4":"in the fourth indigestion and an increase of phlegm","5":"in the fifth the acquisition of sons, status, and real estate","6":"in the sixth it gives diseases and fear","7":"in the seventh Venus produces knowledge","8":"in the eighth position, women, and good health","9":"in the ninth it gives success with regard to speech and money","10":"in the tenth honor and wealth from great men","11":"in the eleventh it causes an increase in one's treasure","12":"and in the twelfth Venus gives the loss of one's business and pleasure"},"Mars":{"1":"Venus in the place of Mars causes offenses and the death of one's wife","2":"in the second imprisonment","3":"in the third many possessions, honor, and enjoyment","4":"in the fourth it gives valor","5":"in the fifth it produces power, courage, and diligence","6":"in the sixth (it gives) beauty and nobility","7":"in the seventh Venus destroys one's wife, one's happiness, and one's prosperity","8":"in the eighth it causes decline and evil","9":"in the ninth Venus (gives) success in arguments and a good wife","10":"in the tenth the loss of one's accumulated possessions","11":"in the eleventh the acquisition of lands, gold, and sons","12":"and in the twelfth power"},"Mercury":{"1":"Venus in the place of Mercury destroys one's virility and beauty","2":"in the second one's wealth","3":"in the third it destroys diseases and one's foes","4":"in the fourth it takes away honor and victory","5":"in the fifth (the native) is a leader in sons, clothes, position, and wealth","6":"in the sixth it gives victory","7":"in the seventh it destroys one's business and power","8":"in the eighth it obstructs one's intelligence and strength","9":"in the ninth it causes worship from men who rise from their seats (to pay their respects), learning, and honor","10":"in the tenth it destroys one's vows","11":"in the eleventh Venus gives lands, sons, and money","12":"and in the twelfth it hinders one's business"},"Moon":{"1":"Venus in the place of the Moon causes the acquisition of gold, women, silver, money, learning, sons, clothes, position, and quadrupeds","2":"in the second the gaining of wealth and a wife","3":"in the third it produces cows, lands, garments, sons, honor, joy, position, women, and good health","4":"in the fourth Venus gives wealth, a wife, sons, friends, good food, clothes, and perfume","5":"in the fifth it gives friends, the birth of sons, the appearance of good qualities, fame, and money","6":"in the sixth Venus causes poverty, quarrels, diseases, hatred, and the loss of one's honor","7":"in the seventh Venus gives debts, wandering, anxiety caused by women, and bad friends","8":"in the eighth women, happiness, publicity, honor, joy, friends, learning, and clothes","9":"in the ninth Venus causes the acquisition of wealth from friends, elders (guru), and women, of righteousness ( dharma), of knowledge, of glory, and of good qualities","10":"in the tenth the loss of one's money, the affection of one's relatives, the profits of one's actions, and one's honor","11":"in the eleventh it produces women, beds, food, drink, ornaments, sexual intercourse, joy, houses, and money","12":"and in the twelfth Venus gives food and happiness, and causes the loss of one's clothes"},"Ascendant":{"1":"Venus in the ascendent produces an abundance of cows, friends, jewels, clothes, gold, women, edible foods, beds, precious stones, and pearls","2":"in the second place it gives a wife, wealth, and grain","3":"in the third Venus gives the acquisition of gold and pearls, and causes the destruction of one's enemies","4":"in the fourth it gives cows, houses, ornaments, women, prosperity, and honor from one's relatives and friends","5":"in the fifth from the ascendent it causes the acquisition and attainment of wealth, honor, a wife, business, and glory","6":"in the sixth Venus produces many quarrels, wanderings, griefs, toils, injuries, and pains","7":"in the seventh quarrels with one's wife, diseases, and sorrows originating in the deceits of women","8":"in the eighth Venus gives various foods, drinks, friends, sciences, and ornaments","9":"in the ninth Venus gives reverence, wealth, and honor from the lords (isvara)","10":"in the tenth Venus produces little livelihood, the aversion of outstanding men, diseases, and illness","11":"in the eleventh Venus gives precious stones, jewels, pearls, women, ornaments, clothes, and food","12":"and in the twelfth place from the ascendent it causes the loss of one's wealth, wandering, and mental delusion"}}