{"Sun":{"1":"The Sun in its own place produces brilliance and honor","2":"in the second wealth and prosperity","3":"in the third a struggle with the forces of one's enemies","4":"in the fourth praise from assemblies of relatives","5":"in the fifth diseases from bile, fevers, old age, and illnesses of one's sons","6":"in the sixth fear of disease","7":"in the seventh it gives health and slays one's enemies","8":"in the eighth it causes the acquisition of beauty and strength","9":"in the ninth (it causes) distress from anger and wandering","10":"in the tenth it produces joy and gives wealth","11":"in the eleventh it brings about the attainment of the results of one's undertakings","12":"and in the twelfth it causes sickness"},"Saturn":{"1":"The Sun in the place of Saturn gives learning and glory","2":"in the second it produces much happiness","3":"in the third loss of wealth and glory","4":"in the fourth fame of one's family","5":"in the fifth the Sun produces a union between one's sons and one's self","6":"in the sixth joy","7":"in the seventh it causes respect from one's enemies and gives food","8":"in the eighth it produces pleasure in quarreling with one's enemies","9":"in the ninth the Sun gives position and prosperity","10":"in the tenth there is success in actions and happiness","11":"in the eleventh it gives various possessions, glories, and joys","12":"and in the twelfth it causes sickness"},"Jupiter":{"1":"The Sun in the place of Jupiter produces despondency and delusion","2":"in the second wealth","3":"in the third loss of position, money, and honor","4":"in the fourth ( the native) is the leader of his relatives and people","5":"in the fifth the Sun gives friendship with equals, sons, and wealth","6":"in the sixth ( the native) subdues his senses","7":"in the seventh it causes delusion, wandering, and illness","8":"in the eighth hostility, diseases, and wandering","9":"in the ninth the Sun gives righteousness (dharma) and money, and (the native) conquers his enemies","10":"in the tenth it produces position and business and gives wealth","11":"in the eleventh the Sun causes honor, happiness, wealth, and success","12":"in the twelfth dishonor"},"Venus":{"1":"The Sun in the place of Venus gives poverty, disease, and wandering","2":"in the second it produces women, wealth, and grain","3":"in the third the Sun gives quarrels with one's wife","4":"in the fourth it causes the misery of his family (varpsa)","5":"in the fifth it gives losses and enemies","6":"in the sixth it produces amusements in many places","7":"in the seventh it gives women and happiness and produces beauty","8":"in the eighth the Sun destroys the pleasure of the body","9":"in the ninth the Sun causes anger and jealousy","10":"in the tenth obstruction in business","11":"in the eleventh glory","12":"and in the twelfth from Venus the Sun brings about success in actions and wealth"},"Mars":{"1":"The Sun in the place of Mars gives money and sons","2":"in the second it produces many possessions","3":"in the third such things as stealing and breaking","4":"in the fourth beauty, strength, and health","5":"in the fifth diseases from bile, fevers, old age, and illnesses of one's sons","6":"in the sixth fear of disease","7":"in the seventh it gives health, and (the native) slays his enemies","8":"in the eighth it causes joy and good fortune","9":"in the ninth the Sun gives position and destroys evil","10":"in the tenth it causes the acquisition of profits","11":"in the eleventh the Sun causes pleasure with many women and glory","12":"in the twelfth ( the native) is grieved by fatigue"},"Mercury":{"1":"The Sun in the place of Mercury gives confusion of memory, breaking, and illness","2":"in the second it causes strife","3":"in the third position and wealth","4":"in the fourth quarrels, fear, and wandering","5":"in the fifth it causes beauty and destroys evil","6":"in the sixth the Sun is the creator of honor and wealth","7":"in the seventh the Sun takes away one's voice and one's wife","8":"in the eighth it produces diseases","9":"in the ninth the Sun gives knowledge and removes illness","10":"in the tenth it causes praises from the best men","11":"in the eleventh (place) from Mercury the Sun produces knowledge, wealth, and beauty","12":"and in the twelfth (the same)"},"Moon":{"1":"The Sun in the place of the Moon produces heart-disease, grief, wandering, quarrels, poverty, anger, losses, diseases, fears, sickness, and robbery","2":"in the second expenses, weariness, and anxiety","3":"in the third the Sun gives wealth, righteousness (dharma), honor, position, pleasure in friends, and happiness","4":"in the fourth it causes a pouring forth of blood from wounds, fevers, diseases, breaks, and quarrels","5":"in the fifth the Sun gives oppression by the king, grief for sons and relatives, and diseases","6":"in the sixth it produces health, happiness, destruction of one's enemies, joy, fame, and success in business","7":"in the seventh it causes a pouring forth of blood, fevers, weariness, old age, poisoning, and wandering","8":"in the eighth the Sun produces sorrow for wife and sons, illness of relatives, losses, misfortunes, and death","9":"in the ninth the Sun produces poverty, a fall in status, and the hatred of one's elders (guru) and relatives","10":"in the tenth it causes the acquisition of human (slaves), quadrupeds, women, gold, lands, and garments","11":"in the eleventh the Sun gives position, glory, joy, dainty foods, health, and wealth","12":"in the twelfth place from the Moon it is said by experts to obstruct gaining profits from business"},"Ascendant":{"1":"The Sun in the ascendent gives glory, praise, position, wealth, prosperity, honor, fame, business, food, and gold","2":"in the second it gives hunger, fatigue, and disease, and destroys one's accumulated possessions","3":"in the third the Sun gives victory, joy, position, good things, wealth, food, and friends","4":"in the fourth it produces pleasure in garlands and sexual intercourse, union with one's relatives, and power","5":"in the fifth it gives toil for one's family (kula), anxiety, quarrels, diseases, losses, and wandering","6":"in the sixth the Sun gives destruction of one's enemies and illnesses, glory, brilliance, joy, respect, and wealth","7":"in the seventh the Sun produces anger, wandering, delusion, sickness, theft, and the illness of one's wife","8":"in the eighth it kills the body with such things as swords, fever, fear of enemies, imprisonment, breaking, and beasts of prey","9":"in the ninth the Sun gives disrespect from the vile, expenses, and the destruction of his acts of righteousness (dharma)","10":"in the tenth the Sun gives quadrupeds, clothes, lands, sons, wives, and servants","11":"in the eleventh the Sun gives many cows, lands, gold, copper, vehicles, seats, position, and happiness","12":"and in the twelfth from the ascendent it takes away treasures and wealth and produces hunger, fatigue, and grief"}}