{"Mars":{"1":"Mars in (its own) place causes victory and wealth","2":"in the second it gives honor and gold","3":"in the third it produces the loss and diminution of one's gold","4":"in the fourth success with regard to friends and money","5":"in the fifth quarrels and the loss of one's respect and wealth","6":"in the sixth diseases, foes, and deceits","7":"in the seventh it destroys sickness, fatigue, and enemies","8":"in the eighth Mars causes honor, glory, and wealth","9":"in the ninth Mars produces unrighteous (adharma) behavior and jealousy","10":"in the tenth eye-injuries","11":"in the eleventh the acquisition of gold and sons","12":"and in the twelfth the loss of one's wife and untruthful behavior"},"Sun":{"1":"Mars in the place of the Sun causes work with fire (smelting)","2":"in the second a bilious disease oftentimes","3":"in the third the destruction of one's foes and the acquisition of copper (tamra) and gold","4":"in the fourth it produces a disease of the limbs","5":"in the fifth Mars produces honor and the acquisition of children","6":"in the sixth victory, power, and good health","7":"in the seventh diseases, wandering, and anger","8":"and in the eighth an ailment caused by poison","9":"in the ninth Mars produces authority, prosperity, and the destruction of one's foes","10":"in the tenth injury to one's enemies","11":"in the eleventh the acquisition of position, gold, and honor","12":"and in the twelfth stumbling and disease"},"Saturn":{"1":"Mars in the place of Saturn causes success with regard to one's deeds in battle","2":"in the second money, prosperity, and respect","3":"in the third it gives quarrels, injuries, and wounds","4":"in the fourth it produces many attainments and power","5":"in the fifth it destroys one's sons, one's enjoyment, one's happiness, and one's wealth","6":"in the sixth it gives enemies and poison","7":"in the seventh it restrains one's foes, fears, and diseases","8":"in the eighth it produces enemies, fatigue, and disease","9":"in the ninth Mars gives respect and wealth","10":"in the tenth it takes away honor and wealth","11":"in the eleventh it produces profits from one's business, goods, money, glory, and beauty","12":"and in the twelfth it gives diseases of the eyes and wandering"},"Jupiter":{"1":"Mars in the place of Jupiter gives enemies, (wounds from) swords, and diseases","2":"in the second it takes away one's thoughts","3":"in the third it causes separation from one's relatives and calamities","4":"in the fourth illnesses of the genitals and belly","5":"in the fifth it gives bilious (diseases), enemies, and separations","6":"in the sixth it produces glory, the acquisition of money, and honor","7":"in the seventh Mars causes offensive behavior by one's wife and diseases","8":"in the eighth death","9":"in the ninth Mars (produces) poverty, removal, and reproach","10":"in the tenth the acquisition of honor, glory, and wealth","11":"in the eleventh the acquiring of position, sons, and money","12":"and in the twelfth disease, hunger, and sickness of the blood"},"Venus":{"1":"Mars in the place of Venus causes diseases of phlegm and blood","2":"in the second the fear of fire","3":"in the third separation from one's wife and advisors and quarrels","4":"in the fourth it gives (wounds from) swords and fire, envy, and fear","5":"in the fifth it produces unkindness by one's relatives and quarrels","6":"in the sixth prosperity","7":"in the seventh Mars gives a wife and a hoard","8":"in the eighth gold and happiness","9":"in the ninth it causes a change in the blood in the body","10":"in the tenth poverty and pain","11":"in the eleventh Mars gives gold and a son","12":"in the twelfth garments"},"Mercury":{"1":"Mars in the place of Mercury causes an increase of one's miseries and foes","2":"in the second perplexity","3":"in the third an increase in joy and pleasure","4":"in the fourth fear of one's enemies","5":"in the fifth it gives enormous wealth and a son","6":"in the sixth glory, honor, and property","7":"in the seventh it gives illness of one's wife, roaming, fatigue, and faults","8":"in the eighth it causes imprisonment","9":"in the ninth Mars causes the loss of one's goods and disrespect","10":"in the tenth indolence, envy, and the loss of one's wealth","11":"in the eleventh the acquisition of lands and gold","12":"and in the twelfth wandering and theft"},"Moon":{"1":"Mars in the place of the Moon causes grief because of kings, fire, wild animals, poison, burning, swords, diseases, distress, and the loss of one's wealth","2":"in the second poverty, envy, illness, and fraud","3":"in the third it produces lordship, honor, brilliance, and joy, and gives food and gold","4":"in the fourth Mars causes belly-aches, fevers, the pouring forth of one's blood, and despair","5":"in the fifth it gives the loss of one's sons and money, wounds, quarrels, thefts, and diseases","6":"in the sixth Mars causes the destruction of one's foes, honor, joy, publicity, good health, and prosperity","7":"in the seventh the loss of one's wealth and property, miseries, diseases of the belly and eyes, and poverty","8":"in the eighth Mars produces illnesses, poison, enemies, sword-wounds, loss, injuries, and poverty","9":"in the ninth Mars causes sword-wounds, insults, the loss of one's gold, jealousy, and wandering","10":"in the tenth diseases, enemies, (wounds from) swords, quarrels, wounds, and illnesses, but afterwards success","11":"in the eleventh it gives honor, sons, authority, lands, copper (tamra), gold, and brilliance, and conquers one's enemies","12":"and in the twelfth Mars gives quarrels with one's wife, anxiety, diseases of the feet, sleepiness, breaking, and fatigue"},"Ascendant":{"1":"Mars in the ascendent causes the destruction of one's foes and increase in one's authority, sons, lands, gold, brilliance, and joy","2":"in the second place it destroys one's position, wealth, and brilliance, and increases one's quarrels","3":"in the third Mars causes the appearance of strength, glory, position, good qualities, and joy","4":"in the fourth Mars produces sword-wounds, fire-wounds, thefts, breaking, and losses","5":"in the fifth place from the ascendent Mars causes the loss of one's money, pain of one's wife and sons, fear, and poverty","6":"in the sixth Mars causes the destruction of one's foes, the acquisition of property, pleasure, and joy","7":"in the seventh Mars causes diseases of the genitals and eyes, an increase of bile, thefts, and the death of one's wife","8":"in the eighth Mars gives bilious (diseases), fevers, blood-(sickness), fatigue, thieves, sword-wounds, losses, and distress","9":"in the ninth it brings forth poverty, foes, and diseases, and destroys beauty and handsomeness","10":"in the tenth place from the ascendent Mars produces wandering, enmity, thefts, wounds, and breaking","11":"in the eleventh Mars gives very brilliant objects of gold or copper (tamra) and children","12":"and in the twelfth place from the ascendent it produces diseases of the feet and eyes, wounds, and robberies"}}