{"Mercury":{"1":"Mercury in its own place gives children, knowledge, and science","2":"in the second it destroys speech and memory","3":"in the third it destroys quarrels, diseases, and illness","4":"in the fourth it produces insipidness in one's speech and intelligence","5":"in the fifth it gives success with respect to good qualities, fame, sons, and money","6":"in the sixth victory","7":"in the seventh Mercury causes disrespect, diseases, and illness","8":"in the eighth it gives diseases and foes","9":"in the ninth Mercury gives success with regard to good qualities and money","10":"in the tenth honor and possessions","11":"in the eleventh the acquisition of lands, gold, and garments","12":"and in the twelfth honor from friends and money"},"Sun":{"1":"Mercury in the place of the Sun destroys virility and the begetting (of children)","2":"in the second it destroys property","3":"in the third it causes fear of one's friends which is stirred up by one's enemies","4":"in the fourth separation from one's family (kutumba)","5":"in the fifth Mercury produces position, fame, and renown","6":"in the sixth it gives intelligence and wealth","7":"in the seventh Mercury causes non-agitation and ascetic indifference","8":"in the eighth it gives diseases and strife","9":"in the ninth Mercury produces money, knowledge, firmness, and righteousness (dharma)","10":"in the tenth it destroys the good","11":"in the eleventh Mercury gives the acquisition of lands and quadrupeds","12":"and in the twelfth science and happiness"},"Saturn":{"1":"Mercury in the place of Saturn gives benefits, joys, and brilliance","2":"in the second lands and wealth","3":"in the third it causes breaking, wandering, diseases, and anger","4":"in the fourth victory, gain, joy, and money","5":"in the fifth the destruction of one's possessions and sons","6":"in the sixth wind (-diseases), blows from boulders, and fevers","7":"in the seventh Mercury causes payments and beauty","8":"in the eighth gain","9":"in the ninth it gives wealth and honor","10":"in the tenth it produces position, wealth, and money","11":"in the eleventh Mercury causes the acquisition of lands, wealth, and gold","12":"and in the twelfth disease"},"Jupiter":{"1":"Mercury in the place of Jupiter gives the destruction of one's wealth and knowledge","2":"in the second it takes away friends and property","3":"in the third it destroys joy and strength","4":"in the fourth Mercury gives strife and delusion","5":"in the fifth Mercury (causes) the loss of one's wealth and honor","6":"in the sixth victory, good health, wealth, and children","7":"in the seventh loss and disease","8":"in the eighth the acquisition of wealth is predicted","9":"in the ninth (it causes) wounds, distress, and delusions","10":"in the tenth ( diseases of the) blood, fatigue, and the loss of one's possessions","11":"in the eleventh goods and prosperity","12":"and in the twelfth it gives fear"},"Venus":{"1":"Mercury in the place of Venus gives sons, women, and sciences","2":"in the second noble wealth","3":"in the third honor and victory","4":"in the fourth a collection of multi-colored paintings","5":"in the fifth Mercury produces cows, lands, and children","6":"in the sixth diseases and the loss of one's money","7":"in the seventh the loss of one's wife, sons, and possessions","8":"in the eighth success with regard to wealth and honor","9":"in the ninth Mercury causes the acquisition of friends and money","10":"in the tenth the loss of one's wealth and fatigue","11":"in the eleventh it causes the gaining of women, gold, clothes, and food","12":"and in the twelfth success"},"Mars":{"1":"Mercury in the place of Mars and in the second place gives wealth which produces at a good interest-rate","2":"Mercury in the place of Mars and in the second place gives wealth which produces at a good interest-rate","3":"in the third it causes disrespect from others and weariness","4":"in the fourth friends, glory, and honor","5":"in the fifth it gives expenses, wandering, and poverty","6":"in the sixth an increase in one's foes and diseases","7":"in the seventh Mercury causes the acquisition of women, beautiful girls, and food","8":"and in the eighth honor","9":"in the ninth Mercury produces success with regard to honor and wealth","10":"in the tenth joy, authority, and glory","11":"in the eleventh success with regard to money","12":"and in the twelfth the desired reversal of evil"},"Moon":{"1":"Mercury in the place of the Moon takes away friendship, knowledge, intellect, and honor","2":"in the second it produces reproaches, pains, quarrels, the interruption of one's business, and poverty","3":"in the third Mercury causes obstruction by one's relatives, diseases, and calamity with respect to one's wealth","4":"in the fourth the acquisition of honor, good qualities, praise, pleasure, women, and wealth","5":"in the fifth Mercury produces calumny, anxiety, purposeless roaming, and distress","6":"in the sixth it causes prosperity, mental joy, and the accumulation of power and possessions","7":"in the seventh Mercury causes evil, journeys, torment, poverty, and the obstruction of one's wealth","8":"in the eighth the help of wise men, intelligence, favor, status, and joy","9":"in the ninth breaking, reproaches, wandering, fatigue, illness, and torments","10":"in the tenth Mercury gives success in business, the acquisition of money, and the respect of men who have confidence in one","11":"in the eleventh it produces honor, quadrupeds, women, friends, money, beauty, and pleasure","12":"in the twelfth Mercury causes anxiety and fatigue from one's work"},"Ascendant":{"1":"Mercury in the ascendent gives lordship, possessions, friends, women, ideas, knowledge, beauty, fame, and quadrupeds","2":"in the second place it gives voice, intelligence, wealth, and friends","3":"in the third it causes the attainment of harshness from one's relatives, separation from one's wife, and the loss of one's beauty","4":"in the fourth Mercury gives friends, money, honor, knowledge, glory, relatives, and good qualities","5":"in the fifth it gives an increase in one's beauty, the acquisition of sons and possessions, honor, and intelligence","6":"in the sixth Mercury takes away beauty and wealth and gives dishonor, poverty, and strife","7":"in the seventh Mercury gives good health, joy, the destruction of evil, and happiness","8":"in the eighth it causes diseases, mental distraction, wanderings, and quarrels, and takes away friendship and intelligence","9":"in the ninth Mercury gives the appearance of adoration, good health, and strength, and success with regard to righteousness (dharma) and money","10":"in the tenth the acquisition of eloquence, the fine arts, sexual intercourse, women, honor, and wealth, and brilliance","11":"in the eleventh Mercury gives the acquisition of women, friends, happiness, sons, and money, publicity, and the praise of wise men","12":"and in the twelfth from the ascendent it produces strife and infamy"}}