{"Moon":{"1":"The Moon in its own place gives food, perfume, garlands, women, friends, garments, and sexual intercourse","2":"in the second it causes many expenses, difficulties, and despair","3":"in the third the Moon gives clothes, gold, women, friends, glory, and food","4":"in the fourth it causes griefs which arise from the sufferings of one's relatives and the loss of one's wealth","5":"in the fifth the Moon causes the loss of one's wealth, indigestion, diseases, wandering, poverty, and agitation","6":"in the sixth the destruction of one's foes, good health, sons, money, success, affection, learning, and joy","7":"in the seventh the Moon gives women, wealth, relatives, beds, gold, food, and clothes","8":"in the eighth hunger, diseases, anxiety, quarrels, loss of one's money, death, decay, and distress","9":"in the ninth the Moon oversees the loss of one's wealth, illness, expenses, the ruin of one's honor, and hindrances","10":"in the tenth it produces much honor, joy, profits from one's activities, nobility, and distinction","11":"in the eleventh affection, the marriage-bed, women, food, joy, happiness, and money","12":"in the twelfth the Moon causes poverty, laziness, and the diminution of one's honor"},"Sun":{"1":"The Moon in the place of the Sun produces misery in one's body","2":"in the second it gives wandering and disease","3":"in the third it causes joy, victory, and good health","4":"in the fourth it gives the breaking of one's weapons and spells (mantra), and fevers","5":"in the fifth it causes an increase in strife and evil","6":"in the sixth joy and victory","7":"in the seventh the Moon gives consideration for one's mother's family (kula)","8":"in the eighth success with regard to money","9":"in the ninth it causes the aversion of one's elders (gurus)","10":"in the tenth it gives power, glory, and wealth","11":"in the eleventh the Moon gives distinguished garments, gold, and metals (loha)","12":"in the twelfth disease"},"Saturn":{"1":"The Moon in the place of Saturn causes hunger and blows with boulders","2":"in the second the diminution of one's money","3":"in the third the acquisition of glory and wealth","4":"in the fourth wind(-diseases), fevers, and poverty","5":"in the fifth the Moon produces wealth and flowers","6":"in the sixth the destruction of one's enemies and an accumulation of strength","7":"in the seventh pain in mind and body","8":"in the eighth the loss of one's money","9":"in the ninth it (causes) wind(-diseases), belly(-aches), indigestion, and failure in one's actions","10":"in the tenth it gives possessions","11":"in the eleventh the Moon causes illness among one's slaves and quadrupeds","12":"in the twelfth quarrels with bad people"},"Jupiter":{"1":"The Moon in the place of Jupiter produces knowledge, wealth, and fame","2":"in the second honor and wealth","3":"in the third it causes separation from one's wife and friends","4":"in the fourth it gives women, enjoyment, prosperity, and wealth","5":"in the fifth the Moon gives status, brilliance, and fear among one's foes","6":"in the sixth it delivers diseases","7":"in the seventh it gives a wife, clothes, and strength","8":"in the eighth wealth and power","9":"in the ninth it causes bondage, mischief, and ill-fame to oneself","10":"in the tenth it conquers one's foes","11":"in the eleventh it causes the acquisition of food and vehicles","12":"and in the twelfth an increase of sickness in the head"},"Venus":{"1":"The Moon in the place of Venus causes agitation in one's wife's family (kula)","2":"in the second ornaments","3":"in the third it gives victory, clothes, and cows","4":"in the fourth merchandise, wealth, and food","5":"in the fifth the Moon produces honor, learning, and fame","6":"in the sixth disease and obstruction","7":"in the seventh an increase in one's poverty","8":"in the eighth it gives sickness and fear","9":"in the ninth the Moon causes honor and victory","10":"in the tenth the attainment of wealth","11":"in the eleventh it gives the acquisition of profit, pleasure, clothes, and women","12":"and in the twelfth it produces joy"},"Mars":{"1":"The Moon in the place of Mars gives wandering, disease, separation, and enemies","2":"in the second it produces power","3":"in the third lordship and pleasure","4":"in the fourth envy, illness, and anxiety","5":"in the fifth authority, reverence, profit, and nobility","6":"in the sixth the murder of one's enemies","7":"in the seventh blood(-diseases), wounds, and faults","8":"in the eighth the Moon gives wandering, imprisonment, and disease","9":"in the ninth the Moon gives brilliance and prosperity","10":"in the tenth authority and beauty","11":"in the eleventh the Moon causes the acquisition of fame and great wealth","12":"and in the twelfth the ruin of one's property"},"Mercury":{"1":"The Moon in the place of Mercury produces such things as children, knowledge, and pleasure","2":"in the second it gives desirable things","3":"in the third it produces beauty, good qualities, and fame","4":"in the fourth confused speech and distress","5":"in the fifth the Moon produces censure and the resorting to evil","6":"in the sixth contempt from an ignoble person (anarya)","7":"in the seventh intellect, joy, and treasure","8":"in the eighth it gives money and status","9":"in the ninth it causes the purity of one's character","10":"in the tenth success with regard to one's words, thoughts, and actions","11":"in the eleventh the Moon gives wealth from one's friends and sons","12":"in the twelfth an increase in one's poverty"},"Ascendant":{"1":"The Moon in the ascendent gives vomiting, fevers, indigestion, strife, fatigue, wandering, enemies, and death","2":"in the second it causes the loss of one's wealth, diseases of the eyes, travels, thefts, expenses, aversion, and anger","3":"in the third the Moon gives honor, women, authority, wealth, garments, lands, and joy","4":"in the fourth the Moon produces quarrels with one's relatives, diseases, poverty, anger, and calumny","5":"in the fifth the illness of one's sons, the loss of one's money, the poisoning of one's friends' affection, and expenses","6":"in the sixth the Moon causes the destruction of one's enemies, honor, good health, and the accumulation of money","7":"in the seventh the Moon produces weariness from wandering, anxiety about one's money, jealousy, sorrow, and homelessness","8":"in the eighth one's own death, hunger, wandering, imprisonment, fever, sword(-wounds), and delusions","9":"in the ninth the Moon causes one's dependence on others, wandering, aversion, greed, delusion, impotence, and dishonor","10":"in the tenth success in business, happiness, the acquisition of wealth, and respect","11":"in the eleventh the Moon causes the acquisition of women, silver, food, drink, good clothes, position, and quadrupeds","12":"in the twelfth from the ascendent trouble in one's business and the loss of one's profits"}}