{"Aries":{"Sun":"The Sun, which is renowned for its brilliance, if it is in a dvadasamsa of Aries, produces the power of the (native's) father.","Moon":"The Moon in a dvadasamsa of Aries establishes a disease of his mother by means of changes caused by blood and bile.","Jupiter":"Jupiter in a dvadasamsa of Aries makes a man having a treasure of gold and goats whose wealth is destroyed by thieves, fire, and foes.","Venus":"Venus in a dvadasamsa of Aries produces one whose wife is polluted, hostile, or dead.","Mars":"Mars in a dvadasamsa of Aries makes a clever man with famous wealth.","Mercury":"Mercury in a dvadasamsa of Aries produces one who speaks much, but in a stumbling way, a fickle person whose friends are ill-behaved and terrible.","Saturn":"Saturn in a dvadasamsa of Aries makes a vile man whose treasure is gained by the acquisitions of his servants, but a strong and handsome man."},"Taurus":{"Sun":"The Sun in a dvadasamsa of Taurus destroys the beauty of his father.","Moon":"The Moon in a dvadasamsa of Taurus gives prosperity, happiness, and food of his mother.","Jupiter":"Jupiter in a dvadasamsa of Taurus bestows firm and extensive wealth.","Venus":"Venus in a dvadasamsa of Taurus produces a man who has intercourse with lovely women and wives.","Mars":"Mars in a dvadasamsa of Taurus makes a pauper.","Mercury":"Mercury in a dvadasamsa of Taurus produces one who is friendly with women and has a firm, loud voice.","Saturn":"Saturn in a dvadasamsa of Taurus makes a man who is doorkeeper in a harem and whose body is slowly overcome by old age."},"Gemini":{"Sun":"The Sun in a dvadasamsa of Gemini makes his father one who practices such things as sacrifices and is wealthy in family.","Moon":"The Moon in a dvadasamsa of Gemini, which creates beauty, the respect of good men, and power, causes the happiness of his mother.","Jupiter":"Jupiter in a dvadasamsa of Gemini makes one whose money is gathered from the fine arts, oratory, and the sacred traditions (sruti).","Mars":"Mars in a dvadasamsa of Gemini makes a person who is the same to men and women and who has ignoble sons.","Venus":"Venus in a dvadasamsa of Gemini produces a man with handsome form who is learned in the fine arts, a clever person who takes pleasure in women.","Mercury":"Mercury in a dvadasamsa of Gemini makes one who is learned in oratory, sacred traditions (sruti), and crafts, whose friends are famous, and who speaks sweetly.","Saturn":"Saturn in a dvadasamsa of Gemini makes a fickle person who practices mischief and bad craftsmanship, and whose old age is attained with the strength of youth."},"Cancer":{"Sun":"If the Sun is in a dvadasamsa of Cancer, then (the native) obtains (a father) who is afflicted by disease, sickness, and troubles.","Moon":"If the Moon is in a dvadasamsa of Cancer, he obtains pleasures of his mother caused by health, beauty, and good appearance.","Jupiter":"Jupiter in a dvadasamsa of Cancer produces the highest, exalted wealth.","Mars":"Mars in a dvadasamsa of Cancer makes one whose sons are lowly.","Venus":"Venus in a dvadasamsa of Cancer produces a man abounding in treasures and titles who has a good wife and possesses a family and beauty.","Mercury":"Because of Mercury in a dvadasamsa of Cancer (the native) obtains powerful friends and the highest joy.","Saturn":"Because of Saturn in a dvadasamsa of Cancer he will grow old quickly, and is carried off by his servants, his bad wives, and so on."},"Leo":{"Sun":"The Sun in a dvadasamsa of Leo causes victory and nobility of his father.","Moon":"The Moon in a dvadasamsa of Leo causes fear and disease of his mother.","Jupiter":"Jupiter in a dvadasamsa of Leo causes the acquisition of wealth consisting mainly of cows which are obtained by labor and by serving his friends and the king.","Mars":"Mars in a dvadasamsa of Leo makes one whose sons are not born or, if born, die.","Venus":"Venus in a dvadasamsa of Leo makes a man who does not obtain a wife.","Mercury":"Mercury in a dvadasamsa of Leo makes a man whose voice is broken and who has bad friends.","Saturn":"Saturn in a dvadasamsa of Leo makes one overcome by old age who is not submissive to his lord."},"Virgo":{"Sun":"The Sun in a dvadasamsa of Virgo gives poverty of his father.","Moon":"The Moon in a dvadasamsa of Virgo gives poverty of his mother and makes him gentle and timid.","Jupiter":"Jupiter in a dvadasamsa of Virgo gives wealth pertaining to maidens.","Mars":"Mars in a dvadasamsa of Virgo causes the birth of eunuchs.","Venus":"Venus in a dvadasamsa of Virgo produces one whose wife has a soft and oppressed body.","Mercury":"Mercury in a dvadasamsa of Virgo makes a man prominent for his oratory and having good friends.","Saturn":"Saturn in a dvadasamsa of Virgo makes a man who grows old slowly, obeying others and serving women and evil people."},"Libra":{"Sun":"The Sun in a dvadasamsa of Libra produces a father whose wealth is excessive, but who is deprived of health.","Moon":"The Moon in a dvadasamsa of Libra destroys the beauty and strength of his mother.","Jupiter":"Jupiter in a dvadasamsa of Libra gives wealth from travels, merchandise, and trade.","Mars":"Mars in a dvadasamsa of Libra produces a rogue with many sons.","Venus":"Venus in a dvadasamsa of Libra produces a man with a noble (Arya) wife who knows business, sexual intercourse, and science.","Mercury":"Mercury in a dvadasamsa of Libra produces a teacher who gives many speeches.","Saturn":"Saturn in a dvadasamsa of Libra produces a youthful person with many servants."},"Scorpio":{"Sun":"The Sun in a dvadasamsa of Scorpio causes the death of his father.","Moon":"The Moon in a dvadasamsa of Scorpio causes the death of his mother.","Jupiter":"Jupiter in a dvadasamsa of Scorpio destroys his wealth.","Mars":"Mars in a dvadasamsa of Scorpio causes the birth of evil, sick, and timid men.","Venus":"Venus in a dvadasamsa of Scorpio produces one whose wife is maimed or has died a violent death.","Mercury":"Mercury in a dvadasamsa of Scorpio produces a man imperfect in speech and having bad friends.","Saturn":"Saturn in a dvadasamsa of Scorpio produces one who is himself a slave and is born of a man like a slave or one who does the commands of and associates with sinful people."},"Sagittarius":{"Sun":"The Sun in a dvadasamsa of Sagittarius gives beauty, dignity, and honor of his father.","Moon":"The Moon in a dvadasamsa of Sagittarius gives beauty, dignity, and honor of his mother.","Jupiter":"Jupiter in a dvadasamsa of Sagittarius gives abundant vehicles, horses, and gold.","Mars":"Mars in a dvadasamsa of Sagittarius causes the birth of one who is looked upon in a hostile manner by his elders.","Venus":"Venus in a dvadasamsa of Sagittarius gives a wife who is praised for her good qualities.","Mercury":"Mercury in a dvadasamsa of Sagittarius gives perfection in speech and friendship and ...","Saturn":"Saturn in a dvadasamsa of Sagittarius causes the birth of youthful men who have the good fortune of Cupid."},"Capricorn":{"Sun":"The Sun in a dvadasamsa of Capricorn causes the loss of his father.","Moon":"The Moon in a dvadasamsa of Capricorn causes a wind-disease of his mother.","Jupiter":"Jupiter in a dvadasamsa of Capricorn destroys the acquisition of good, peacefulness, and memory.","Mars":"Mars in a dvadasamsa of Capricorn causes the birth of famous sons.","Venus":"Venus in a dvadasamsa of Capricorn produces a man whose wife has trembling limbs and twitching eye-brows.","Mercury":"Mercury in a dvadasamsa of Capricorn produces a man defective in speech whose friendship is bad.","Saturn":"Saturn in a dvadasamsa of Capricorn produces a man who ages quickly and is surrounded by tanks, cows, and servants."},"Aquarius":{"Sun":"The Sun in a dvadasamsa of Aquarius causes disease, sickness, and defects of his father.","Moon":"The Moon in a dvadasamsa of Aquarius causes disease, sickness, and defects of his mother.","Jupiter":"Jupiter in a dvadasamsa of Aquarius gives memory and wealth.","Mars":"Mars in a dvadasamsa of Aquarius gives servants, slaves, and sons.","Venus":"Venus in a dvadasamsa of Aquarius produces a man who is the husband of a slave-girl or of an old woman.","Mercury":"Mercury in a dvadasamsa of Aquarius produces one who is robbed of speech and has bad friends.","Saturn":"Saturn in a dvadasamsa of Aquarius produces a man with good friends who looks like an old man or who is honored by slaves."},"Pisces":{"Sun":"The Sun in a dvadasamsa of Pisces causes joy, honor, and wealth of his father.","Moon":"The Moon in a dvadasamsa of Pisces causes joy, honor, and wealth of his mother.","Jupiter":"Jupiter in a dvadasamsa of Pisces makes many heaps of jewels.","Mars":"Mars in a dvadasamsa of Pisces gives sons who are hostile to his allies.","Venus":"Venus in a dvadasamsa of Pisces produces one whose wife is opposed by a great arhat.","Mercury":"Mercury in a dvadasamsa of Pisces produces a man corrupted in speech who has evil friends.","Saturn":"Saturn in a dvadasamsa of Pisces produces a youthful person who serves men of good qualities."}}